Bob Smith's workstation (we8105desk) was connected to a file server during the ransomware outbreak. What is the IPv4 address of the file server?
I know his IP, and that a file server likely communicates over SMB:
index="botsv1" src_ip=192.168.250.100 source="stream:smb" 
|  stats count by path
Top result was 192.168.250.20.

How many distinct PDFs did the ransomware encrypt on the remote file server?
I filtered on the pdf file type and the host name of the IP above. I also excluded DLLs because there is a .pdf.dll file in the mix. And I showed a unique count:
index="botsv1" "*.pdf*" NOT dll host=we9041srv
| stats dc(Relative_Target_Name)
Answer: 257

